The '''Spring Path''' is a [[Location]] found on the {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}. It connects the bottom part of the island to the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}.

{{ZoneText|Climb up to the peak of &bTorrhus Springs&f.|Meet &bMiria &fand partake in &dMiria's Contests&f.|Keep an eye out for pesky &7Mountain Goats&f!}}
== Features ==
The '''Spring Path''' serves as a connecting path to the {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}. It starts just near {{NPCSprite|Honey}}'s booth and {{Zone|Miria's Hut}}. 

On the path, players can find {{MobSprite|Mountain Goat}}s and {{NPCSprite|Hunter Jean}}. There are also some water pools that players can go [[Fishing]] from.

